"""
Toltec I Ching — Transparency Layer
====================================
All 64 hexagrams from The Toltec I Ching by William Douglas Horden
and Martha Ramirez-Oropeza (Larson Publications, 2009).

Integrated with permission of the author for use as a transparency
layer in the Oracle diagnostic engine. The Toltec sequence is a
distinct arrangement from King Wen, connected via trigram substitution.

Fields per hexagram:
  name       — Toltec hexagram name
  king_wen   — corresponding King Wen number
  trad_name  — traditional King Wen name
  symbol     — Unicode hexagram symbol
  image      — visual/symbolic description
  interp     — full interpretation
  action     — guidance on action
  intent     — guidance on intent/inner work
  summary    — concise summary
  lines      — dict of 6 line change readings
  stages     — archetypal stages (primary, secondary)
"""


